{"term": {"label": "禮", "occurrences": 15, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-ii", "title": "告子下", "description": "任人有問屋廬子曰：「禮與食孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n「色與禮孰重？」曰：「禮重。」\n曰：「以禮食，則飢而死；不以禮食，則得食，必以禮乎？親迎，則不得妻；不親迎，則得妻，必親迎乎！」\n屋廬子不能對，明日之鄒以告孟子。孟子曰：「於答是也何有？不揣其本而齊其末，方寸之木可使高於岑樓。金重於羽者，豈謂一鉤金與一輿羽之謂哉？取食之"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "千", "id": "千"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "奚", "id": "奚"}, {"form": "妻", "id": "妻"}, {"form": "就", "id": "就"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "必", "id": "必"}, {"form": "桀", "id": "桀"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "色", "id": "色"}, {"form": "迎", "id": "迎"}, {"form": "重", "id": "重"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.606403232289698, "source": "迎", "target": "妻"}, {"weight": 2.065958191342549, "source": "迎", "target": "必"}, {"weight": 1.4469189829363254, "source": "迎", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.690112500415543, "source": "桀", "target": "就"}, {"weight": 1.591500211747433, "source": "桀", "target": "重"}, {"weight": 0.8873031950009027, "source": "必", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.6604930832343845, "source": "必", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 2.1400661634962708, "source": "知", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 3.606403232289698, "source": "知", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 2.759105371902494, "source": "知", "target": "生"}, {"weight": 2.402430427963762, "source": "千", "target": "色"}, {"weight": 0.8873031950009027, "source": "去", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.1400661634962708, "source": "色", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.9132560517297525, "source": "色", "target": "重"}, {"weight": 2.220108871169807, "source": "色", "target": "取"}, {"weight": 2.6255739792779718, "source": "色", "target": "奚"}, {"weight": 2.2735975561207935, "source": "食", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.35364026379433, "source": "食", "target": "重"}, {"weight": 1.6604930832343845, "source": "食", "target": "取"}, {"we